  "description": "Women’s Hair Conditioner for Dry & Frizzy Hair Reduces Frizz: This Hair Conditioner for women is one of the best hair conditioners in India enriched with Silk protein, biotin & niacinamide that helps repair dry, frizzy, and unruly hair. This deep conditioner helps remove the frizz and dryness from the hair strands and makes them smooth and lustrous, making it an effective conditioner for dry hair. Smoothens Hair Strands: Silk protein in this conditioner for frizzy hair helps smoothen hair strands and add shine and lustre to treat such frizziness. Locks in Moisture: Shea butter in our hair conditioner for women prevents water loss and hair breakage. It retains moisture in the hair strands, making the hair look hydrated & voluminous. For best results, use Bodywise Deep Conditioner for Dry Hair for 3 months. 200 ml | Two months usage Get 20% cashback in your BW Purse",
